# Throwaway GPU capability probe (see README architecture notes)
.probe/

# Fetched third-party asset binaries. Reproducible byte-for-byte from
# tools/assets/manifest.json + assets.lock.json via `npm run assets`, so they
# are not worth carrying in git history.
#
# Deliberately NOT ignored, because they are the licence record and must be
# reviewable in the repo: public/ATTRIBUTIONS.md, public/ATTRIBUTIONS.json,
# public/assets/licenses/ (the licence text archived from each source).
public/assets/*
!public/assets/licenses/

